### vNext Runtime API — {{workflowKey}}
### REST Client (.http) — for manual exploration. The xUnit integration tests are CI's source of truth.
### Endpoint contracts: .claude/references/state-function-response.md, incidents-and-retry.md,
### instance-query.md, human-task.md, long-poll-interaction.md, roles-and-authorization.md.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = {{domain}}
@workflowKey = {{workflowKey}}
# Caller identity for a local runtime without a gateway (CallerRoleProvider default → `role` header)
@role = tester

### Start a new instance (sync → response carries metadata.effectiveStatus)
# @name start
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/start?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
role: {{role}}

{
  /* Initial payload — match the workflow's master schema required fields */
}

###
@instanceId = {{start.response.body.$.id}}

### Get current state (poll: server answers immediately with 200 or 304; role-filtered transitions[])
# @name state
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/state
role: {{role}}

### Same, conditional — expect 304 while nothing in the ETag material changed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/state
role: {{role}}
If-None-Match: {{state.response.headers.ETag}}

### Execute a manual transition (PATCH; 409 Instance:100031 while the instance is Busy)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/{transition-key}?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json
role: {{role}}

{
  /* Transition payload — match the transition's input schema */
}

### updateData (configured key; admitted unconditionally, delta-only payload, target $self)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/{update-data-key}
Content-Type: application/json
role: {{role}}

{
  /* only the fields that change */
}

### Cancel / exit (bypass the busy check)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/{cancel-key}
role: {{role}}

### Acknowledge a long-poll termination (state body carried interaction.ack.href)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/longpoll/ack
role: {{role}}

### Authorize probe — what the gateway asks before forwarding (exactly one selector)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/authorize?transitionKey={transition-key}
role: {{role}}

### Authorize — may this caller read the instance (queryRoles chain)?
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/authorize?queryRoles=true
role: {{role}}

### Instance data / master schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/data
role: {{role}}

### Function catalog for this instance (role-filtered, hrefs → /info)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/catalog
role: {{role}}

### Function contract discovery
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/functions/{function-key}/info
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/functions/{function-key}/view?target=input
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/functions/{function-key}/schema?target=input

### Call a function on this instance (verbs[] mismatch → 405 + Allow)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/{function-key}
Content-Type: application/json
role: {{role}}

{}

### Task / action history (metadata only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/tasks
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/functions/actions?taskId={task-id}

### Incidents — active (404 Instance:100037 = none) and history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/incidents/active
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/incidents?page=1&pageSize=20

### Retry a Faulted instance (400 Instance:100027 otherwise)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/retry?sync=true

### Human-task inbox for this domain (leaf state subType 6, authorised by its queryRoles)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/functions/human-task
role: {{role}}

### Query instances — filter uses WIRE operator names; sort is JSON; instanceType/effectiveStatus are columns
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances?filter={"and":[{"status":{"eq":"A"}},{"attributes":{"amount":{"ge":1000}}}]}&sort={"field":"createdAt","direction":"desc"}&page=1&pageSize=20

### List all instances
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances
